From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:28:52 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 159/162] GreatDANE: follow live namespace_synced; show sync
 basis

Lazy mode uses the node's live namespace_synced flag and does not latch
it or re-apply the height < activation gate, so an offline fixture tip
below activation can be treated as synced. about:dane surfaces
namespace_sync_basis and best_known_height. E2E uses a height>0
zeroblob fixture against a real lazy node.
